NOTE ON THE CONTENT

This license covers the *source code* of this repository only.

The media catalog that the application describes — 5,000 photographs from
Unsplash, 285 sound recordings from Wikimedia and Pixabay, and 258 videos from
Pexels and Wikimedia — is **not** covered by it. Every item remains under the
license of its provider (Unsplash License, CC BY-SA / public domain, Pexels
License, Pixabay Content License). The catalog is generated at build time and
is not committed here.

The EmbeddingGemma 2 model weights are distributed by Google under the Gemma
terms of use and are not redistributed here either.
